      "message": "nit: if the body raises and this flush also fails, the caller gets the flush\u0027s `GitError` instead of the original error. let\u0027s swallow flush errors on the exception path\n\n```suggestion\n        try:\n            yield\n        except BaseException:\n            self._batch_depth -\u003d 1\n            if self._batch_depth \u003d\u003d 0:\n                try:\n                    self._FlushBatch(save_json\u003dTrue)\n                except Exception:\n                    self._batch_ops.clear()\n                    self._batch_json_dirty \u003d False\n                    self.ClearCache()\n                    self._RemoveJson()\n            raise\n        else:\n            self._batch_depth -\u003d 1\n            if self._batch_depth \u003d\u003d 0:\n                self._FlushBatch(save_json\u003dTrue)\n```",
      "range": {
