      "message": "queued values will stay in `_cache` and `_batch_json_dirty` if `_do` fails here. let\u0027s catch, reset, and re-raise (taken from https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/git-repo/+/652263/ which also has a test for this change)\n\n```suggestion\n        try:\n            for name, vals in ops:\n                self._do(\"--replace-all\", name, vals[0])\n                for extra in vals[1:]:\n                    self._do(\"--add\", name, extra)\n        except BaseException:\n            self._batch_json_dirty \u003d False\n            self.ClearCache()\n            self._RemoveJson()\n            raise```",
